MARA: I’m not saying you’re wrong. I’m saying the sun is going down.', 'HUM-BANK-N1-P06'),
  ('HUM-BANK-N1-P06-Q5', 'humanities', 'hard', 60, 'What is Mara’s main concern in her final line?', '["The map she holds is badly out of date.","Time is running out before dark.","Theo has insulted her.","The road splits again soon."]'::jsonb, 1, 'She points out that the sun is going down.', 'MARA: (not looking up from the map) We could just ask someone.
